<body>
  <h1>Tsuivan(Mongolian food)</h1>
  <h2>What You Need</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>2 cups of flour</li>
    <li>meat, potato, carrots</li>
    <li>Mongolian seasoning</li>
    <li>Sesame oil</li>
    <li>add and kimchi if you like</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Steps</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Cook the meat and let it cool slightly.</li>
    <li>Add the vegtables.</li>
    <li><strong>Warning: use medium heat</strong> when frying the them all.</li>
    <li>add the noodles</li>
    <li>Add <em>salt</em> and sesame oil, then mix everything together.</li>
  </ol>
